0..59 Comment "//! `outlived` reads a thunk after its holding region ends."
60..63 Comment "//!"
64..145 Comment "//! `pass` returns at its input region. A binding with no region cannot hold that"
146..193 Comment "//! result. The checker reports `TypeMismatch`."
